{"id":4274,"date":"2017-11-27T17:27:27","date_gmt":"2017-11-27T22:27:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=4274"},"modified":"2017-11-27T17:27:27","modified_gmt":"2017-11-27T22:27:27","slug":"foretravel-coach-plant-tour-nacogdoches-tx","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/11\/27\/foretravel-coach-plant-tour-nacogdoches-tx\/","title":{"rendered":"Foretravel Coach Plant Tour &#8211; Nacogdoches, TX"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Winnebago, Avion, Jayco, Fleetwood, Airstream, Coachman, Thor, and so many other RV names were familiar to us.\u00a0 Many have been around for years and years and enjoy a long history of making quality recreational vehicles.<\/p>\n<p>I recently wrote a post on our <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/10\/06\/airstream-factory-tour\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Airstream factory tour<\/a> in Jackson Center, Ohio when we were on our way from our <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/08\/13\/workamping-at-pere-marquette-rv-park-baldwin-mich\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Michigan summer workamping gig<\/a> to our Texas winter workamping gig.<\/p>\n<p>I only recently (within the last year or so) became familiar with the coach building company known as <a href=\"http:\/\/www.foretravel.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FORETRAVEL<\/a>.\u00a0 I realized we were going to be right past the home of Foretravel at <a href=\"https:\/\/goo.gl\/maps\/M8a2dbbE3GH2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nacogdoches, Texas<\/a>.\u00a0 &#8220;So let&#8217;s go take their factory tour too, eh?&#8221;<\/p>\n<p>Like the Airstream factory, Foretravel also offers low cost ($5\/nite) camping for it&#8217;s customers and visitors.\u00a0 We pulled in to the parking area in the afternoon and found that the plant tour would be at 10 am the next morning.\u00a0 We took the opportunity that afternoon to talk to one of their in-house sales reps so we could look at their used inventory and then we also drove up the street a mile or so and met with Brad at Motorhomes of Texas to see what they had in their Foretravel inventory.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4367\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4367\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.19.46.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4367 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.19.46.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.19.46.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.19.46-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.19.46-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.19.46-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4367\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The front of the main Foretravel plant and corporate offices at Nacogdoches<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4368\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4368\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.24.49.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4368 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.24.49.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.24.49.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.24.49-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.24.49-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.24.49-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4368\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Our parking spot for the night at the factory &#8220;campground&#8221;<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4369\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4369\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-09.38.24.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4369 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-09.38.24.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-09.38.24.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-09.38.24-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-09.38.24-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-09.38.24-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4369\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The back of the main building showing the service and delivery prep bays<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>(The following is taken from &#8220;The History of Foretravel&#8221; on the corporate web site.)<\/p>\n<p><em>&#8220;The business of building motorhomes came about not due to planning by the Fores, but by the traveling they did in their self-built motorhome.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>From that modest beginning in 1967 with the 29\u2019 \u201cSpeedy Marie\u201d motorhome produced in the backyard of C.M. &amp; Marie Fore, Foretravel continued to set the standard. Weathering the oil embargos of the early 1970\u2019s Foretravel introduced the first diesel-powered motorhome in 1974.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>In addition to the numerous conveniences of a Foretravel, i.e., VCR\u2019s, central vacuum cleaners, icemakers, trash compactors, Foretravel was among the first to use fiberglass instead of aluminum, real hardwood, and a full air bag suspension.&#8221;<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Foretravel continues to be a top-notch motorhome manufacturer.\u00a0 At present, they make 2 Class &#8220;A&#8221; coaches &#8211; The model <strong>IH-45<\/strong>, selling for about $1,000,000 and the &#8220;entry level&#8221; coach labeled the &#8220;<strong>Realm<\/strong>&#8221; that sells somewhere in the $800,000 range.<\/p>\n<p>Unlike Airstream that makes about 100 units per month and has about 1200 employees, Foretravel has only about 160 employees and manufactures about only 25 units <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">PER YEAR<\/span>!\u00a0 Their paint process alone requires about 2000 man hours to complete.<\/p>\n<p>Also unlike Airstream, the Foretravel factory tour allowed us to take pictures!<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4370\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4370\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.24.24.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4370 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.24.24.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.24.24.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.24.24-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.24.24-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.24.24-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4370\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The &#8220;power&#8221; end of the new IH-45 coach<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4371\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4371\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.45.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4371 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.45.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.45.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.45-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.45-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.45-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4371\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">One of the &#8220;basement&#8221; compartments showing electronic wiring.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4372\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4372\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.50.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4372 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.50.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.50.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.50-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.50-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.27.50-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4372\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Two frame assemblies with basement compartments side by side<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4373\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4373\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.35.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4373 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.35.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.35.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.35-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.35-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.35-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4373\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Aluminum box frame side wall assemblies ready to be mounted on basement frame box<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4374\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4374\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.41.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4374 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.41.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.41.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.41-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.41-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.31.41-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4374\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Front end of the coach frame shows (green) Onan diesel 12kw generator<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4375\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4375\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.35.33.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4375 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.35.33.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.35.33.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.35.33-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.35.33-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.35.33-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4375\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">One of the side slide assemblies that will be placed into a sidewall<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4376\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4376\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.49.09.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4376 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.49.09.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.49.09.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.49.09-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.49.09-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.49.09-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4376\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">An entire drivers side sidewall (front end at right end of image)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4377\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4377\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.50.54.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4377 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.50.54.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.50.54.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.50.54-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.50.54-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.50.54-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4377\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Now the wall has been lifted into place on the coach basement frame ready to be attached<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4378\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4378\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.52.22.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4378 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.52.22.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.52.22.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.52.22-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.52.22-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.52.22-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4378\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Basement pass through storage compartments<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4379\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4379\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.55.47.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4379 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.55.47.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.55.47.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.55.47-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.55.47-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.55.47-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4379\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Aluminum box frame (front end of coach)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4380\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4380\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.00.56.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4380 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.00.56.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.00.56.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.00.56-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.00.56-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.00.56-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4380\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The power end of the coach showing one of the slides extended<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4381\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4381\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.05.15.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4381 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.05.15.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.05.15.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.05.15-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.05.15-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.05.15-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4381\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Workers installing the one piece windshield<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4382\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4382\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.06.56.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4382 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.06.56.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.06.56.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.06.56-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.06.56-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.06.56-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4382\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Installing one of the large slide units<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Some of the features that the Foretravel coaches have that really appeal to me are;<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>8 (or 10 if there&#8217;s a tag axle) &#8220;outboard&#8221; air bags.\u00a0 They place their air bags at the extreme outboard end of where the axle meets the frame just inside the side wall.\u00a0 Most coach chassis makers have the air bags inside the wheels so the airbags might be 4 or 5 feet apart whereas with the Foretravel coaches the airbags are more like 8 feet apart.\u00a0 This gives the coach much better stability and far less side-to-side rocking when driving into or out of a driveway.<\/li>\n<li>No slide gaskets or seals that are exposed to the exterior.\u00a0 No slide trim panels that overlap the sidewall.\u00a0 Foretravel uses the HWH expanding bladder to seal the slide to the outside wall.\u00a0 When the slide is retracted or extended, there is a vacuum placed on the bladder.\u00a0 Once the wall is completely in or out, then the bladder is pressurized to provide an airtight weatherproof seal.\u00a0 This system not only provides an airtight seal, but when the slides are closed (retracted), the face of the slide is perfectly and completely flush with the sidewall.<\/li>\n<li>Pass-through basement storage drawers (full height from side to side)<\/li>\n<li>Aqua-Hot heating system uses hot water circulated through heat exchangers in the cabin for warm, quiet heat.\u00a0 This is diesel powered and also provides hot water to the bath and kitchen.<\/li>\n<li>CAT (on older models) and Cummins 450hp and up engines along with Allison Electronic Transmissions (3000 series on older coaches, 4000 series on newer) along with driver-controlled 4-position transmission retarder.\u00a0 This style retarder gives the operator far superior speed control during steep downhill grades &#8230; better than an exhaust retarder or engine brake.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4385\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4385\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.56.56.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4385 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.56.56.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.56.56.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.56.56-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.56.56-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-10.56.56-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4385\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Here&#8217;s a cross-section of the HWH slide bladder seal that pressurizes to seal<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>These next few photos show Kathy getting just a little TOO comfortable inside the new Foretravel REALM that just rolled off the factory floor.\u00a0 It&#8217;s a darn shame it was already sold &#8230; aw shucks.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.22.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4387\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.22.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.22.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.22-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.22-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.22-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.34.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4388\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.34.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.34.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.34-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.34-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.34-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.50.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4389\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.50.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.50.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.50-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.50-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.43.50-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Here&#8217;s that REALM on the outside.\u00a0 I gotta admit &#8211; I do like the paint scheme<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.44.31.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4390\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.44.31.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.44.31.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.44.31-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.44.31-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-12-11.44.31-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a>Oh, take a look at the steps.\u00a0 These are not your typical RV steps.\u00a0 Most motorhomes today use electric RV steps known as Kwikee Steps made by Lippert Industries.\u00a0 These high-end steps are known as &#8220;Executive&#8221; brand steps made by Braund Industries.<\/p>\n<p>I was really impressed with these steps when we were at the factory.\u00a0 Our coach steps are well worn and rattle a lot as we&#8217;re going down the road.\u00a0 \u00a0So I thought, &#8220;boy I&#8217;d like to get a set of those steps for <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">our<\/span> coach&#8221;\u00a0 I did some research online when I got home.\u00a0 Those steps would cost us about $5000 !!!!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Not Happnin&#8217; !<\/p>\n<p>Here&#8217;s a few pix of older Foretravel coaches that we looked at in the $125k-$175k range.\u00a0 We like to look, but we&#8217;ll keep our Airstream for now.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4391\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4391\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.41.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4391 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.41.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.41.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.41-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.41-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.41-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4391\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2003 Model U-320 38&#8242; w\/ tag axle &amp; 2 Slides<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4392\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4392\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.58.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4392 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.58.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.58.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.58-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.58-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-14.53.58-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4392\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2003 Model U-320 36&#8242; w\/ 2 slides<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4393\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4393\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-15.44.40.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4393 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-15.44.40.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-15.44.40.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-15.44.40-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-15.44.40-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-15.44.40-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4393\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">2000 Model U-295 40&#8242; w\/ 1 Slide<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>NOTE: We&#8217;re doing some interior remodeling and some performance and suspension upgrades to our present Airstream coach and we&#8217;ll be publishing posts on those projects soon, once we have all the projects completed.<\/p>\n<p>Oh, I almost forgot &#8230;. when we were in Nacogdoches we asked where we should have dinner that night and were referred to the Fredonia Hotel downtown.\u00a0 We weren&#8217;t disappointed.\u00a0 Kathy had shrimp and I had salmon.\u00a0 The food was excellent, the presentation beautiful and the service outstanding.\u00a0 Hats off to our server Brett.\u00a0 Here&#8217;s a few pix of our delectable delights.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4394\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4394\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.28.30.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4394 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.28.30.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.28.30.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.28.30-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.28.30-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.28.30-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4394\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The dining room at the Fredonia overlooking the patio and pool<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4395\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4395\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.04.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4395 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.04.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.04.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.04-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.04-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.04-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4395\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">My Atlantic Salmon dinner<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4396\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4396\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.10.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4396 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.10.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.10-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.10-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-17.41.10-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4396\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kathy&#8217;s Shrimp Dinner w\/ Broccoli Cole Slaw<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4397\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4397\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.26.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4397 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.26.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.26.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.26-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.26-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.26-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4397\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">We were good &#8230;. we didn&#8217;t take anything off the desert tray<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4399\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4399\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.56.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4399 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.56.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.56.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.56-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.56-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.01.56-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4399\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Yes, the lounge chairs are IN the pool<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4400\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4400\" style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.02.39.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4400 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.02.39.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.02.39.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.02.39-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.02.39-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.02.39-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4400\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The Front Lobby and Registration Desk<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.03.09.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4401\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.03.09.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.03.09.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.03.09-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.03.09-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/11\/2017-10-11-18.03.09-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Winnebago, Avion, Jayco, Fleetwood, Airstream, Coachman, Thor, and so many other RV names were familiar to us.\u00a0 Many have been around for years and years and enjoy a long history of making quality recreational vehicles. I recently wrote a post on our Airstream factory tour in Jackson Center, Ohio when we were on our way &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/11\/27\/foretravel-coach-plant-tour-nacogdoches-tx\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Foretravel Coach Plant Tour &#8211; Nacogdoches, TX<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,18285,586,264,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707495,554707493,554707491,554707497,12619279,554707494,554707492,554707496,554707499,554707498],"class_list":["post-4274","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-equipment","category-food","category-learning","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-coach","tag-factory-tour","tag-foretravel","tag-ih-45","tag-luxury-coach","tag-motorhome","tag-nacogdoches","tag-realm","tag-u295","tag-u320"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4274","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4274"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4274\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4404,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4274\/revisions\/4404"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4274"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4274"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4274"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}